{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Dream of Limbo</i> is a dark fairytale-style bullet-hell action game.<br>Players control Psyche, a highly mobile protagonist who uses dashes and dives to break platforms and enemy projectiles, taking on 19 powerful bosses in intense and visually striking battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/f5d1b143eea9c8cff1fbe9525a286bd6.poster.avif?t=1771255455\" width=1080 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/f5d1b143eea9c8cff1fbe9525a286bd6.webm?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/f5d1b143eea9c8cff1fbe9525a286bd6.mp4?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Platform System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a boss is defeated, Psyche acquires a special platform with a unique trait.<br>With 16 different platform types to mix and match, you can create the most effective combination to counter enemies and express your strategy and playstyle in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/afd209038d03d056b310cf384f0b8c11.poster.avif?t=1771255455\" width=1080 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/afd209038d03d056b310cf384f0b8c11.webm?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/afd209038d03d056b310cf384f0b8c11.mp4?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Partner System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psyche fights alongside three partners, each with distinct offensive and defensive traits.<br>By timing your partner summons and activating their skills, you can overturn the battle in critical moments and create new opportunities for counterattacks and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/172edb9096c933ba3e9cc14cf0c7209b.poster.avif?t=1771255455\" width=1080 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/172edb9096c933ba3e9cc14cf0c7209b.webm?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2658230?t=1771255455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/bdd6b0e13a88ef9c7b7dc27e144e0551bc408f7f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771255455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/543fb65ab9e79e0738b9e7d8820e1cdbe1119efd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771255455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/543fb65ab9e79e0738b9e7d8820e1cdbe1119efd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771255455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3406820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Dream of Limbo</i> is a dark fairytale-style bullet-hell action game.<br>Players control Psyche, a highly mobile protagonist who uses dashes and dives to break platforms and enemy projectiles, taking on 19 powerful bosses in intense and visually striking battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/f5d1b143eea9c8cff1fbe9525a286bd6.poster.avif?t=1771255455\" width=1080 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/f5d1b143eea9c8cff1fbe9525a286bd6.webm?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/f5d1b143eea9c8cff1fbe9525a286bd6.mp4?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Platform System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a boss is defeated, Psyche acquires a special platform with a unique trait.<br>With 16 different platform types to mix and match, you can create the most effective combination to counter enemies and express your strategy and playstyle in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/afd209038d03d056b310cf384f0b8c11.poster.avif?t=1771255455\" width=1080 height=1080 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/afd209038d03d056b310cf384f0b8c11.webm?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658230/extras/afd209038d03d056b310cf384f0b8c11.mp4?t=1771255455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Partner System</strong>